// Synthetic m1-eval multirate fixture. No proprietary content.
// 100 Hz: writes Fast Shared = Slow Out + 1. Reads the 50 Hz Slow Out across
// rates. The global schedule plan orders the slow writer before this reader on
// common due ticks; on intervening fast ticks this function reads the held
// Slow Out value. Same-rate Fast Reader depends on this writer.
Fast Shared = Slow Out + 1.0;
